What's New in Version 3.2.0

- Added Biometric Login Support: Securely and quickly access your account using Face ID or Touch ID.
- New In-App Notification Center: Stay informed with all your updates and alerts in one convenient location.
- Dark Mode: You can now toggle Dark Mode from your settings for a more comfortable viewing experience.
- Scheduled Payments: Plan ahead by scheduling your payments directly within the app.
- Performance Improvements: We've optimized the app startup time by 40% for a faster, smoother experience.
- Bug Fixes: We've resolved issues causing crashes in the inbox and corrected balance display errors after transfers.
